### Регистрация (USER или ARTIST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "ivan", "email": "ivan@mail.com", "password": "secret123", "role": "USER" }

### Вход -> получить token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "user", "password": "user123" }

### Список треков (подставьте токен)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracks?q=night
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Добавить в избранное
POST http://localhost:8080/api/favorites/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Избранное
GET http://localhost:8080/api/favorites
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Удалить из избранного
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/favorites/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Начать прослушивание
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listening
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{ "trackId": 1 }

### История прослушиваний
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listening/history
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Скачать/проиграть аудио трека
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/1/stream
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Исполнитель: загрузить аудио к треку (multipart, поле file)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tracks/6/audio
Authorization: Bearer <ARTIST_TOKEN>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=B

--B
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="song.mp3"
Content-Type: audio/mpeg

< ./song.mp3
--B--

### Исполнитель: добавить трек (artist / artist123)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tracks
Authorization: Bearer <ARTIST_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "New Song", "artist": "The Neon Waves", "genre": "Pop", "durationSeconds": 190 }

### Исполнитель: статистика
GET http://localhost:8080/api/artist/stats
Authorization: Bearer <ARTIST_TOKEN>

### Администратор: пользователи / смена роли / статистика
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>

###
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/3/role
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "ARTIST" }

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>
